# Redesign spacing + type — AppSizes and AppTextStyles only

When redesigning any screen in doctor_app, use `lib/core/app_styles/app_sizes.dart` and `lib/core/app_styles/app_text_styles.dart` (copied from Ali Therapy Admin). Do not invent new padding, margin, gap, radius, icon, or font sizes. Do not retrofit screens that have not been redesigned unless asked.

## Type (Admin scale)

- heading1 28 / heading2 22 / heading3 18
- bodyLarge 16 / body 14 / bodySmall 12
- label 12 w500 / button 16 w600 / appBarTitle 18 w700 / name 16 w700
- chips 12
- Use `style: AppTextStyles.body` on `CustomText` (styles already include `.sp`). Never pass `AppTextStyles.*.fontSize` into `CustomText.fontSize` (that double-scales).

## Tokens

- Page (home, lists): `AppSizes.pageInsets` (16 / 12 / 24)
- Auth: `AppSizes.authInsets` (24)
- Cards: `AppSizes.cardInsets`, `AppSizes.radiusMd` (18)
- Fields / primary buttons: `AppSizes.radiusSm` (12), field padding 14, button height `AppSizes.buttonHeight` (50)
- Section title → content: `AppSizes.spaceMd` (10); between sections: `AppSizes.spaceXxl` (22)
- Horizontal gaps: `gapSm` 8 / `gapMd` 12 / `gapLg` 16
- Icons: `iconSm` 20 / `iconMd` 22 / `iconLg` 24 / `iconXl` 30
- Tablet: same tokens; constrain with `AppSizes.contentMaxWidth` (720 / 1000). No extra raw tablet padding (no 32/40).
- ScreenUtil base: phone `390×844`; tablet portrait `834×1194`; tablet landscape `1194×834` (`AppSizes.screenUtilDesignSize`).

```dart
// BAD
padding: EdgeInsets.symmetric(horizontal: 20.w);
SizedBox(height: isTablet ? 28 : 16.h);

// GOOD
padding: AppSizes.pageInsets;
SizedBox(height: AppSizes.spaceXxl);
```

Keep existing logic (bloc, validation, navigation). UI-only unless asked otherwise.
